function property_swap_recipient_is_leverager() public {
    // Verify that after openLeveragedPosition with swapParams,
    // the Leverager contract itself receives the swap output (not an external address).
    // We test this indirectly: after opening, leverager should hold 0 residual
    // denomination tokens (they were borrowed + repaid), but the vault deposit
    // should reflect tokens actually present in leverager at deposit time.

